<!doctype lake><title>𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐫𝐚 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭-𝐈𝐈</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><meta name="autoSpacing" content="1" /><h1 data-lake-id="p3y0O" id="p3y0O" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9570e579" id="u9570e579">🌀</span><span data-lake-id="ufe9a22d9" id="ufe9a22d9"> 𝐒𝐩𝐢𝐧𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ua505241a" id="ua505241a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u20039b79" id="u20039b79">针对权重、激活值以及键值缓存的训练后量化（Post-Training Quantization，PTQ）技术，能够显著降低大语言模型的内存占用、推理延迟与功耗。然而，当模型中存在异常值时，低比特量化通常会引入较大的量化误差</span></strong></p><ul list="u22ede0bb"><li fid="u7efc21bd" data-lake-id="uf8d872d5" id="uf8d872d5"><span data-lake-id="ua35756ac" id="ua35756ac">已有研究主要通过两类方式缓解这一问题。一类方法在权重和激活值之间重新分配量化难度；另一类方法则采用混合精度表示，对异常值进行单独处理</span></li><li fid="u7efc21bd" data-lake-id="u27e4a759" id="u27e4a759"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufdadbed9" id="ufdadbed9" style="color: #2A4200">从新的角度研究异常值问题：通过为权重矩阵和激活矩阵引入旋转变换，削弱异常值并改善张量的量化友好性</span></strong></li><li fid="u7efc21bd" data-lake-id="uaf369510" id="uaf369510"><span data-lake-id="u62fbe253" id="u62fbe253">受 Elhage et al. 和 SliceGPT 的启发，本文利用神经网络中的旋转不变性，从恒等映射中构造成对出现的旋转矩阵。由于这些旋转矩阵可以被吸收到相邻的权重矩阵中，因此不会改变模型整体的函数映射和全精度输出。应用随机旋转后，权重或激活值中的元素通常能够形成更加均匀、异常值更少的数值分布，从而降低低比特量化的难度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u00da9b8c" id="u00da9b8c"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3ce9f95" id="ua3ce9f95">尽管随机旋转在统计意义上通常能够改善模型的量化性能，但实验表明，不同旋转矩阵对应的量化效果可能存在较大差异。例如，在零样本推理任务上，不同随机旋转矩阵所得到的平均准确率差距最高可达 13 个百分点</span></strong></p><ul list="u3b758521"><li fid="uf953c1ce" data-lake-id="uf06507e1" id="uf06507e1"><span data-lake-id="uef3f5dd7" id="uef3f5dd7">随机选择旋转矩阵并不能充分发挥旋转变换的潜力。基于这一观察，本文提出 SpinQuant，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uac79e9d8" id="uac79e9d8" style="color: #DF2A3F">一种通过学习旋转矩阵来优化量化网络精度的新型方法。SpinQuant 在冻结预训练模型权重的情况下，直接优化旋转矩阵，使旋转后的权重与中间激活值更加适合低比特表示</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u07f9b7c3" id="u07f9b7c3"><span data-lake-id="u3e3eaddc" id="u3e3eaddc">在优化过程中，预训练模型的原始权重保持固定，仅更新旋转矩阵。为保证旋转矩阵始终满足正交约束，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5fddd58d" id="u5fddd58d" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">SpinQuant 采用 Cayley-SGD，在 Stiefel 流形上优化旋转参数。该优化过程不会改变全精度模型的输出，而是通过重新组织模型内部权重和激活值的数值分布，使中间表示更加适合低比特量化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u26d7a039" id="u26d7a039"><span data-lake-id="u831989b3" id="u831989b3">针对不同的计算复杂度与量化精度需求，SpinQuant 提出两种旋转策略：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0aaa44f2" id="u0aaa44f2">SpinQuant-no-had 和 SpinQuant-had</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u09a24c51" id="u09a24c51" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1784987161819-be3bd625-3684-46ee-9dd5-b2e0657b1d8b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u97dce006-15c5-43d2-91c7-77a09baad82%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uabe6895e-406a-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A789%2C%22height%22%3A304%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A205927%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1176%2C%22originHeight%22%3A453%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22EDUCEOUTLIERSINSIDETHEBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A161%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A266%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2CREDUCEOUTLIERSINSIDETHEBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A754%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A258%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%86M%22%2C%22x%22%3A591%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GUANTIZEWEIGHTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A752%2C%22y%22%3A410%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MULTI-HEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SELF-ATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A357%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUANTIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A410%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUANTIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A477%2C%22y%22%3A411%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEEDFORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A698%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MERGEAND%22%2C%22x%22%3A750%2C%22y%22%3A388%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AROTATIONS%22%2C%22x%22%3A181%2C%22y%22%3A411%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A267%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTWHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A1005%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K-VCACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A386%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTIVATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A944%2C%22y%22%3A409%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTIVATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A474%2C%22y%22%3A388%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTIVATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A1078%2C%22y%22%3A410%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROTATIONS%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A411%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTMAX%22%2C%22x%22%3A315%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDINGW%22%2C%22x%22%3A39%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NETWORK%22%2C%22x%22%3A709%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORIGINAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1078%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%40R%22%2C%22x%22%3A199%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A1037%2C%22y%22%3A216%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MERGEABLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A388%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WDOUWM%22%2C%22x%22%3A1027%2C%22y%22%3A242%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WOATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A727%2C%22y%22%3A270%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROTATED%22%2C%22x%22%3A945%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22x%22%3A568%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%40R%22%2C%22x%22%3A556%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONLINE%22%2C%22x%22%3A198%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22x%22%3A1107%2C%22y%22%3A309%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROPEF%22%2C%22x%22%3A146%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROPER%22%2C%22x%22%3A135%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B)%22%2C%22x%22%3A575%2C%22y%22%3A309%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SWISH%22%2C%22x%22%3A820%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RW%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W%22%2C%22x%22%3A742%2C%22y%22%3A202%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1%22%2C%22x%22%3A1080%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R3%22%2C%22x%22%3A157%2C%22y%22%3A372%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A64%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1%22%2C%22x%22%3A836%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R3%22%2C%22x%22%3A694%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A168%2C%22y%22%3A386%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R4%22%2C%22x%22%3A901%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R%22%2C%22x%22%3A635%2C%22y%22%3A41%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R4%22%2C%22x%22%3A164%2C%22y%22%3A409%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A628%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R%22%2C%22x%22%3A189%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%BDA%22%2C%22x%22%3A438%2C%22y%22%3A381%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R%E4%BA%861%22%2C%22x%22%3A295%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf8f6%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uc75de94d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub74b2fd1" id="ub74b2fd1"><strong><span data-lake-id="uac58e073" id="uac58e073">SpinQuant-no-had 主要包含</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F91d0164eb56d754c681b6836351f26eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rYSJ6%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u911181d1" id="u911181d1">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xgi5C%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u700e5cf9" id="u700e5cf9">两类旋转</span></strong></p><ul list="uaf97d047"><li fid="u1ec810d8" data-lake-id="u1184fa8f" id="u1184fa8f"><span data-lake-id="ua1f6a662" id="ua1f6a662">这两类旋转矩阵均可直接吸收到对应的预训练权重矩阵中。在模型推理阶段，只需使用经过旋转和量化后的权重替换原始权重，无须修改模型的前向传播过程，也不会引入额外的在线旋转计算</span></li><li fid="u1ec810d8" data-lake-id="u876e49f1" id="u876e49f1"><span data-lake-id="ue5229497" id="ue5229497">SpinQuant-no-had 在保持原始网络结构和推理流程不变的同时，能够有效改善模型权重及层间激活值的量化特性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u68579638" id="u68579638"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ff7fc8e" id="u8ff7fc8e">SpinQuant-had 主要面向激活值或 KV Cache 采用极低比特量化的场景，例如 4 比特量化</span></strong></p><ul list="u321163c2"><li fid="ueac582bb" data-lake-id="uf99f015e" id="uf99f015e"><span data-lake-id="u747f9a93" id="u747f9a93">除</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F91d0164eb56d754c681b6836351f26eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X8v74%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uedccf8fd" id="uedccf8fd">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe476e3afcce9b01bf236a200099b8e12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22po8fM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3bc0338" id="uf3bc0338">之外，SpinQuant-had 进一步引入在线 Hadamard 旋转矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda6fb24836e26265addcd045f38dd5ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FE2V7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue67747fb" id="ue67747fb">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b3df3e42ed893f993f851a75b170eff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fFYyb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u236114ee" id="u236114ee">，分别用于处理多层感知机模块内部的激活异常值，以及 KV Cache 中的异常值问题</span></li><li fid="ueac582bb" data-lake-id="u03ba6b90" id="u03ba6b90"><span data-lake-id="u66f0f1ef" id="u66f0f1ef">与完全吸收到权重中的离线旋转不同，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d1ee1635466effb6bf6949892e750b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZbfnL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1054b49" id="ue1054b49">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b3df3e42ed893f993f851a75b170eff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M5171%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u26406caa" id="u26406caa">需要在推理过程中在线执行。然而，Hadamard 变换具有结构化和计算复杂度较低等特点，因此能够以较小的计算开销显著改善激活值与 KV Cache 的数值分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u83a7befd" id="u83a7befd"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf13d393d" id="uf13d393d" style="color: #70000D">通过联合使用可学习的离线旋转和结构化在线 Hadamard 旋转，SpinQuant 能够有效控制权重、激活值以及 KV Cache 在极低比特量化条件下产生的误差，并显著提高量化大语言模型的推理精度</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="LZHiz" id="LZHiz" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7f354008" id="u7f354008">🚀</span><span data-lake-id="u49fcea46" id="u49fcea46"> 𝐌𝐎𝐓𝐈𝐕𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u2116ba16" id="u2116ba16"><strong><span data-lake-id="u782ac15c" id="u782ac15c">量化通过降低神经网络中权重或激活值的数值精度，以减少模型的内存占用并降低推理延迟。量化过程可以表示为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u7c424311" id="u7c424311" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_Q%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clfloor%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BX_R-%5C%5Cbeta%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crceil%20%2B%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd2279d2a8923f221d3a195da961e1db0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M47um%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc2400783"><li fid="u31233345" data-lake-id="u413f2b77" id="u413f2b77"><span data-lake-id="u06f34d36" id="u06f34d36">在对称量化中</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufa407363" id="ufa407363" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmax%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%7CX_R%5C%5Cright%7C%5C%5Cright)%7D%20%7B2%5E%7BN-1%7D-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cbeta%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff496dbd8a2bf0ef55b37ac24febc71af.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e9eSc%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u66e3548d"><li fid="u60fa35de" data-lake-id="u3dd06194" id="u3dd06194"><span data-lake-id="u3a14fde1" id="u3a14fde1">在非对称量化中</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ueec5a358" id="ueec5a358" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmax(X_R)-%5C%5Cmin(X_R)%7D%20%7B2%5EN-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cbeta%3D%5C%5Cmin(X_R)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb838a39001a4c9ce9452e9872ddb33f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lkRdk%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uace2c406"><li fid="ucc0be17a" data-lake-id="u8db531ce" id="u8db531ce"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc80af60c363a10d0da2da92626e309aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uLLNg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89c7631b" id="u89c7631b">表示量化后的张量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_R%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd737ed984023eb426078dd5206c8ab82.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TSSmU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud925bc39" id="ud925bc39">表示采用 FP16 格式存储的实值张量，N 表示量化位宽</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8a6f24bb" id="u8a6f24bb"><span data-lake-id="u30ed4457" id="u30ed4457">对于大语言模型，异常值的存在会显著扩大权重或激活值的数值范围，从而增加普通数值的重构误差。本文提出采用经过优化的旋转变换来削弱异常值。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u53874d32" id="u53874d32">直观而言，随机旋转矩阵能够在统计意义上将幅值较大与较小的权重分量进行混合，使其形成异常值更少、数值分布更加规则的表示，从而降低量化难度</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u52a09182" id="u52a09182" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1784988002999-8152138e-d299-454a-a6c5-ad579d72cbf0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubc7cef83-c03d-4097-8ae8-773997406cc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u7ac4987d-315f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A794%2C%22height%22%3A204%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A107495%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1332%2C%22originHeight%22%3A342%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A462%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A225%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BEFOREROTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A230%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A128%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AFTERROTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A1206%2C%22y%22%3A52%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BEFOREROTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A772%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AFTERROTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A231%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYER1D%22%2C%22x%22%3A230%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22751001251%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A259%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FTERROTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A774%2C%22y%22%3A143%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A451%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A197%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AYERLD%22%2C%22x%22%3A670%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B9%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A373%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A95%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AYERLD%22%2C%22x%22%3A1109%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.40%22%2C%22x%22%3A904%2C%22y%22%3A34%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22x%22%3A235%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22x%22%3A1112%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.35%22%2C%22x%22%3A907%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.3%22%2C%22x%22%3A909%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22x%22%3A676%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A519%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A4%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E9%22%2C%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NM%22%2C%22x%22%3A765%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A902%2C%22y%22%3A138%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A126%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A81%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f9%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2d37828d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud20ebc1b"><li fid="ucbe87198" data-lake-id="u6b10638d" id="u6b10638d"><span data-lake-id="ub87948cc" id="ub87948cc">峰度用于衡量实值随机变量概率分布的尾部特性。较大的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ckappa%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd12014c7697fc976c5d8ea02bd692191.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sQ9Ca%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u62a4573c" id="u62a4573c">通常意味着分布中存在更多异常值，而当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ckappa%20%5C%5Capprox%203%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65799baafb536df544ce292e30eaab23.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oMONl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5d01812" id="ua5d01812">时，通常表明该分布接近高斯分布</span></li><li fid="ucbe87198" data-lake-id="u64e368a6" id="u64e368a6"><span data-lake-id="u6487dc76" id="u6487dc76">Transformer 中原始激活值分布包含大量异常值，许多层的峰度甚至超过 200。将激活值与随机旋转矩阵相乘后，所有层的峰度均下降至约 3。这说明旋转后的激活值呈现出更加接近高斯分布的形态，因此更适合进行低比特量化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf7a6abe0" id="uf7a6abe0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub7c279bd" id="ub7c279bd">尽管随机旋转在统计意义上通常能够改善量化性能，但并非所有随机旋转矩阵都会产生相同的量化结果</span></strong></p><ul list="uef8c0f96"><li fid="ua9f6c4bd" data-lake-id="uc6a6c04a" id="uc6a6c04a"><span data-lake-id="u4d96fe08" id="u4d96fe08">研究人员对 LLaMA-2 7B 模型进行 100 次随机实验。每次实验均采用不同的随机旋转矩阵，并将模型的权重和激活值同时量化至 4 比特，即 W4A4 配置，随后评估模型在零样本任务上的平均准确率。不同随机旋转矩阵所对应的模型性能存在显著差异。其中，最佳随机旋转矩阵所得到的平均准确率比最差随机旋转矩阵高出 13 个百分点</span></li><li fid="ua9f6c4bd" data-lake-id="u723491a0" id="u723491a0"><span data-lake-id="u9473be17" id="u9473be17">随机 Hadamard 矩阵的整体表现优于一般的随机旋转矩阵。Hadamard 矩阵能够对旋转后权重的最大幅值给出更加紧致的上界。然而，即使采用随机 Hadamard 旋转矩阵，模型最终性能仍然存在不可忽略的波动，其准确率差异最高可达 6 个百分点</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf7668221" id="uf7668221"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3ab4146" id="ub3ab4146" style="color: #DF2A3F">鉴于不同旋转矩阵在多次实验中表现出巨大的性能方差，一个自然的问题是：能否直接优化旋转矩阵，从而最大化旋转变换对量化性能的提升作用？</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="JswB0" id="JswB0" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u65a953f4" id="u65a953f4">🐢</span><span data-lake-id="ubfcb94c6" id="ubfcb94c6"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucf55b19d" id="ucf55b19d">𝐑𝐎𝐓𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝐏𝐀𝐑𝐀𝐌𝐄𝐓𝐄𝐑𝐈𝐙𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="ue40c207b" id="ue40c207b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u416b41ea" id="u416b41ea">本节介绍 SpinQuant，一种面向量化损失、在大语言模型中引入并优化旋转变换的量化框架</span></strong></p><ul list="ub459f847"><li fid="u5513fb3c" data-lake-id="u38dfd9cd" id="u38dfd9cd"><span data-lake-id="u87199bab" id="u87199bab">针对主流大语言模型架构定义一组旋转参数化形式，包括两个可被合并至权重矩阵中的旋转矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c1fd819f40f538cc45d3b543c7a4007.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pkRxT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u12c9e439" id="u12c9e439">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe476e3afcce9b01bf236a200099b8e12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k3Mo3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua6b12c11" id="ua6b12c11">。这两种旋转能够保证全精度网络的函数映射保持不变</span></li><li fid="u5513fb3c" data-lake-id="ufe567dfd" id="ufe567dfd"><span data-lake-id="ubb432e0a" id="ubb432e0a">引入两个需要在线计算的 Hadamard 旋转</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda6fb24836e26265addcd045f38dd5ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OsKFP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f39d141" id="u7f39d141">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b3df3e42ed893f993f851a75b170eff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vKymK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b8487e2" id="u8b8487e2">，以进一步抑制激活值与 KV Cache 在极低比特量化条件下的异常值</span></li><li fid="u5513fb3c" data-lake-id="u1ef23f9d" id="u1ef23f9d"><span data-lake-id="uc097a003" id="uc097a003">介绍如何以量化网络的目标损失为优化目标，在 Stiefel 流形上对这些旋转矩阵进行联合优化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uce7cf31f" id="uce7cf31f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6fe84e81" id="u6fe84e81">残差路径中的激活旋转：将嵌入层输出</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62721e230a6b8ef4402a375c7f1b82a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lSUuL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub578bca6" id="ub578bca6">与一个随机旋转矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F91d0164eb56d754c681b6836351f26eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QoJSx%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u61fe107e" id="u61fe107e">相乘，从而对残差路径中的激活值进行旋转。该旋转能够减少异常值，并降低从残差路径读取输入的全连接层对输入激活值进行量化的难度</span></strong></p><ul list="u3d61879c"><li fid="u578b01b7" data-lake-id="u2435075b" id="u2435075b"><span data-lake-id="u348ccf90" id="u348ccf90">在旋转后的激活值进入包含非线性运算的注意力模块和前馈网络之前，乘以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%5E%7BT%7D%EF%BC%88%3DR_1%5E%7B-1%7D%EF%BC%89%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7be9e6b2dd3b56b5acbce93f6fd0165e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v7skq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7ff40e88" id="u7ff40e88">，以执行逆旋转。在不存在量化的情况下，无论采用何种旋转，全精度网络均保持不变</span></li><li fid="u578b01b7" data-lake-id="u41bf1d40" id="u41bf1d40"><span data-lake-id="u90598418" id="u90598418">这些旋转矩阵可以合并到相应的权重矩阵中。完成吸收后，网络中不会引入新的参数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0e9ac16a" id="u0e9ac16a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u588fa501" id="u588fa501">注意力模块中的激活旋转：在注意力模块中，通过乘以</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe476e3afcce9b01bf236a200099b8e12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22in9VA%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc60ea11" id="ucc60ea11">对 Value 矩阵进行旋转，并以注意力头为单位，将输出投影层的输入激活值乘以</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_2%5ET%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F36371836efee1f93126097a867cf3387.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jU6Mn%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u81bf68ea"><li fid="u0faa3045" data-lake-id="u6e711270" id="u6e711270"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22salL9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ccc7006" id="u0ccc7006">的形状为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bhead%7D%7D%2C%20D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bhead%7D%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6a59a40f4ba29de10f46df82e40daa3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lyJpk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9487bc5" id="ua9487bc5">，并且不同网络层可以独立选择各自的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W0MIW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf51a41b7" id="uf51a41b7">。由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XFZXy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u98629b4b" id="u98629b4b">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%5ET%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1f7d56ff78c730376cb9f5fd5607dfb4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cuhK7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua0e40c31" id="ua0e40c31">之间不存在其他算子，因此这两个旋转可以在全精度网络中相互抵消</span></li><li fid="u0faa3045" data-lake-id="u0585404a" id="u0585404a"><span data-lake-id="uaccdf2c8" id="uaccdf2c8">该旋转能够改善 Value Cache 和输出投影层输入激活值的量化效果，并且不会向网络中引入任何新的参数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaa1c75f6" id="uaa1c75f6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u34b4c657" id="u34b4c657">额外的未吸收旋转：为在更低比特的激活值量化场景中，例如 4 比特量化，进一步增强对异常值的抑制能力，在前馈网络模块内部引入 Hadamard 矩阵乘法，即</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b3df3e42ed893f993f851a75b170eff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qcs6m%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8be62a9" id="ud8be62a9">，以减少下投影层输入激活值中的异常值</span></strong></p><ul list="ub33dd9cf"><li fid="ud481813d" data-lake-id="u91f4c086" id="u91f4c086"><span data-lake-id="u84d822a5" id="u84d822a5">Hadamard 旋转可以使用快速 Hadamard 变换进行计算，因此仅会给推理延迟带来很小的额外开销。类似地，当需要进行低比特 KV Cache 量化时，也可以插入 Hadamard 矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda6fb24836e26265addcd045f38dd5ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G1JcY%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue2b50117" id="ue2b50117"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc9f4138b" id="uc9f4138b">将同时使用全部旋转矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F91d0164eb56d754c681b6836351f26eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dy5Jv%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaef7795c" id="uaef7795c">、</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qdhyc%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ff053c0" id="u8ff053c0">、</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d1ee1635466effb6bf6949892e750b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xw4DO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uab841320" id="uab841320">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F16431477028e0f565492157004921e2a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IWsEv%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3cb67cda" id="u3cb67cda">的完整方法记为 SpinQuant-had</span></strong></p><ul list="u0e058e17"><li fid="uc29ba9c4" data-lake-id="u0253e5f6" id="u0253e5f6"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F91d0164eb56d754c681b6836351f26eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y07dl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1362d96e" id="u1362d96e">：作用于残差流的全局可学习旋转，可合并至权重</span></li><li fid="uc29ba9c4" data-lake-id="u8f9ad14d" id="u8f9ad14d"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WSm7X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63048293" id="u63048293">：作用于每个注意力头 Value 通道的可学习旋转，可合并至权重</span></li><li fid="uc29ba9c4" data-lake-id="u15e18e45" id="u15e18e45"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d1ee1635466effb6bf6949892e750b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xv7XG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60cba09d" id="u60cba09d">：面向低比特 KV Cache 量化的在线 Hadamard 旋转</span></li><li fid="uc29ba9c4" data-lake-id="u13d4b655" id="u13d4b655"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b3df3e42ed893f993f851a75b170eff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22njWIG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6504107d" id="u6504107d">：面向前馈网络内部低比特激活量化的在线 Hadamard 旋转</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u98ad6180" id="u98ad6180"><strong><span data-lake-id="u00f03168" id="u00f03168">引入四个旋转矩阵可以在保持全精度网络数值一致性的同时提升量化性能。由于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda6fb24836e26265addcd045f38dd5ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a1Wcs%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b5beeed" id="u6b5beeed">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F16431477028e0f565492157004921e2a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ap99R%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u79c58fde" id="u79c58fde">属于在线旋转操作，即无法被吸收到权重矩阵中，因此将其保留为 Hadamard 矩阵。因为在线 Hadamard 变换可以被高效实现，而不会引入显著的额外开销。优化目标定义为：寻找最优的旋转矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c1fd819f40f538cc45d3b543c7a4007.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ShvO1%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u402878a6" id="u402878a6">和 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GEDRS%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u04d440a9" id="u04d440a9">，使量化网络的最终损失最小</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2e13acf0" id="u2e13acf0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cunderset%7BR%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin%7D%5C%5C%3B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BQ%7D(R_1%2CR_2%5C%5Cmid%20W%2CX).%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d888ff3d7d003b2a9bc65647d00238f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xbFb6%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u46d4ae57"><li fid="u2b267f5c" data-lake-id="uebd0f699" id="uebd0f699"><span data-lake-id="uc11f256a" id="uc11f256a">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76389b5c1663c1de7d1d054779306ade.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XtOTE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd051284" id="ubd051284">表示 Stiefel 流形，即所有正交矩阵构成的集合。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BQ%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f9decc4f120c9878764ab62d271601b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hzf9s%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2646fa42" id="u2646fa42">表示在校准集上计算的任务损失，例如交叉熵损失。在预训练权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa36915ecf0b5605493f5aeaf1480a9ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Beu1V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d6afd80" id="u8d6afd80">和输入张量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62721e230a6b8ef4402a375c7f1b82a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EGZ2M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30bc6fb9" id="u30bc6fb9">固定，并且网络中包含量化函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F27fc9cac17259612f01ac1f42db6120b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G1FCR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e9cd4af" id="u7e9cd4af">的情况下，损失是关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7BR_1%2CR_2%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7025c65ce1638dc6d6a5d724ec9d2e27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vKpuT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9365c98c" id="u9365c98c">的函数</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="AKD9m" id="AKD9m" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u132f8525" id="u132f8525">🦞</span><span data-lake-id="ue6c9cd81" id="ue6c9cd81"> 𝐂𝐚𝐲𝐥𝐞𝐲-𝐎𝐏𝐓𝐈𝐌𝐈𝐙𝐄𝐃 𝐑𝐎𝐓𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uf37b698b" id="uf37b698b"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufc033dfc" id="ufc033dfc">为在 Stiefel 流形上优化旋转矩阵，采用 Cayley SGD 方法。该方法是一种用于 Stiefel 流形优化的高效算法。更具体地，在每次迭代中，旋转矩阵 R 的更新被参数化为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc1688d65" id="uc1688d65" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R'%20%3D%20%5C%5CDelta_R(Y)R%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(I-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%7B2%7DY%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(I%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%7B2%7DY%5C%5Cright)R%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd189b41dbfbce623423dafa60e78e2bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NOvhi%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u06b27cc0"><li fid="u2af80b20" data-lake-id="u4c911ba1" id="u4c911ba1"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta_R(Y)%3A%3D%5C%5Cleft(I-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%7B2%7DY%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cleft(I%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%7B2%7DY%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c0766a0fa8a003114eb2e8ee49fba95.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z5rKA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3916676b" id="u3916676b">表示反对称矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6204886f5cc39a4b860ea98a7e95af1d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hWMb2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u573a0e60" id="u573a0e60">的 Cayley 变换，并且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%5E%5C%5Ctop%3D-Y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09ff0edbe9e3da79ae165ea2140c1797.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UKSdg%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u2af80b20" data-lake-id="ud9e1ce5d" id="ud9e1ce5d"><span data-lake-id="uf0067290" id="uf0067290">矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0bfa106d98c3b7b8e9bfd6c70cb5b65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zBO9X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2b65dd4d" id="u2b65dd4d">由损失函数梯度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22G%3A%3D%5C%5Cnabla_R%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BQ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F175b39140a7139a4a85bdcdeaea04891.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g0qyf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf76308a" id="ucf76308a">的投影</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ca4488d5151952c252f25711f1ed562.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vMEBh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue2c3da06" id="ue2c3da06">计算得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufad7ea29" id="ufad7ea29" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3D%5C%5Chat%7BG%7D-%5C%5Chat%7BG%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Chat%7BG%7D%20%3A%3D%20GR%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7DRR%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7DGR%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70e8d87983ce70c70419c59b0b4b9494.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HdkLd%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u63b21755"><li fid="u33e02383" data-lake-id="u7b6254e8" id="u7b6254e8"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta_R(Y)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb534e80f69e039792b05c756f19c47f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bNPHM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce745493" id="uce745493">始终是正交矩阵。因此，只要 R 是正交矩阵，更新后的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R'%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40996f19815d510ff7593c8788cacca4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qayhf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u51a595c3" id="u51a595c3">也能够保证满足正交性，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R'%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7DR'%3DI%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd56c43c1f734fa6612c71f9dcba4ff9f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iwESA%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u33e02383" data-lake-id="u694b1d17" id="u694b1d17"><span data-lake-id="ubc2b7581" id="ubc2b7581">尽管涉及矩阵求逆，但新的旋转矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R'%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40996f19815d510ff7593c8788cacca4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QhCBm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57f18519" id="u57f18519">可以通过高效的定点迭代方法进行计算。与朴素 SGD 算法相比，该方法仅需约 2 倍的单次迭代计算时间，即可始终保持旋转矩阵的正交性质</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua55c4b19" id="ua55c4b19"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e8c2dc7" id="u6e8c2dc7">采用 Cayley SGD 方法求解</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7BR_1%2CR_2%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7025c65ce1638dc6d6a5d724ec9d2e27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aVBpl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc3338d7f" id="uc3338d7f">，同时冻结网络底层的权重参数。</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7BR_1%2CR_2%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7025c65ce1638dc6d6a5d724ec9d2e27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aIxJa%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u124e4cb1" id="u124e4cb1">的参数规模仅约占模型权重规模的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220.26%5C%5C%25%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F74cc2f96a181a698bab69c14d5d5b35a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zBfNo%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u57c19c85" id="u57c19c85">，并且受到正交性约束。因此，底层浮点网络保持不变，旋转操作只会影响模型的量化性能</span></strong></p><ul list="ufaf4ff9b"><li fid="u81a3e67c" data-lake-id="u5c63fba4" id="u5c63fba4"><span data-lake-id="ue3b26f4a" id="ue3b26f4a">当采用不同随机种子进行初始化时，经 Cayley 优化得到的旋转矩阵表现出极小的性能方差。在优化开始时，使用随机 Hadamard 矩阵对旋转矩阵进行初始化。消融实验进一步表明，即使采用随机旋转矩阵进行初始化，优化后的旋转矩阵同样具有较强的稳健性</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="nWDCe" id="nWDCe" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9975a1f0" id="u9975a1f0">🐧</span><span data-lake-id="u2199886c" id="u2199886c"> 𝐅𝐋𝐀𝐓𝐐𝐔𝐀𝐍𝐓: 𝐅𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐧𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐌𝐚𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐬 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐋𝐋𝐌 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u5d306178" id="u5d306178"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf2e2b013" id="uf2e2b013" style="color: #663000">量化通过降低模型参数和激活值的数值精度，从而减少模型的内存占用并加速推理过程。量化误差通常被用作衡量量化方法性能的重要指标。影响量化误差的一个关键因素是权重和激活分布的平坦性</span></strong></p><ul list="u3f9896fa"><li fid="u458d492d" data-lake-id="ua9387c12" id="ua9387c12"><span data-lake-id="u6602ba44" id="u6602ba44">直观而言，当权重或激活的分布较为尖锐，并且存在多个远离主体分布的数值时，将这些数值映射至相同的量化值通常会产生较大的量化误差</span></li><li fid="u458d492d" data-lake-id="uf65af87d" id="uf65af87d"><span data-lake-id="u4acbb091" id="u4acbb091">由于 LLM 的计算结果需要逐层经过 Transformer 网络传播，因此，降低量化误差也有助于减缓误差在 Transformer 层间的传播与累积</span></li><li fid="u458d492d" data-lake-id="u89047b00" id="u89047b00"><span data-lake-id="u4cfa0a95" id="u4cfa0a95">LLM 的激活中往往存在极端离群值，同时还存在所谓的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucbdb77a0" id="ucbdb77a0">枢轴 Token（Pivot Tokens）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8455dcf3" id="u8455dcf3">。为缓解这一问题，已有大量工作提出在量化之前引入不同的变换，以削弱离群值所带来的影响</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u199746ef" id="u199746ef"><strong><span data-lake-id="u83abc7a3" id="u83abc7a3" style="color: #663000">作者重新审视这些变换方法后发现，它们在提升分布平坦性方面仍然存在不足</span></strong></p><ul list="uf8a53296"><li fid="u7cfa801b" data-lake-id="u320c0c7a" id="u320c0c7a"><span data-lake-id="u28dacbde" id="u28dacbde">逐通道缩放（Per-channel Scaling）旨在平衡权重与激活之间的离群值，但难以进一步将离群值分散至其他非离群通道</span></li><li fid="u7cfa801b" data-lake-id="ue300e8b5" id="ue300e8b5"><span data-lake-id="u8c6dd252" id="u8c6dd252">近期提出的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ff0fdbf" id="u5ff0fdbf">Hadamard 变换</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u695efc85" id="u695efc85">试图解决这一问题，但该方法并未充分考虑不同线性层自身的特性</span></li><li fid="u7cfa801b" data-lake-id="u42190013" id="u42190013"><span data-lake-id="u37be41f9" id="u37be41f9">此外，这些方法所引入的线性变换不可避免地会产生额外的推理开销，从而影响量化所能够带来的整体推理加速效果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue65ed92a" id="ue65ed92a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u39ca2974" id="u39ca2974" style="color: #AD1A2B">FLATQUANT 的目标是为每一个线性层寻找最优的仿射变换，并利用校准数据（Calibration Data），通过一种轻量级的逐块训练策略对这些变换进行优化。为降低仿射变换所带来的推理开销，FLATQUANT 利用两个轻量级矩阵构造高效的 Kronecker 积变换，从而同时降低额外的内存需求和计算开销</span></strong></p><ul list="uf9821083"><li fid="u36404897" data-lake-id="u32445ef5" id="u32445ef5"><span data-lake-id="u2ed5f116" id="u2ed5f116">该方法能够与多种量化技术兼容，例如</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3334867a" id="u3334867a">可学习截断（Learnable Clipping）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucf8e248d" id="ucf8e248d">，同时也可以应用于多种量化场景，包括仅权重量化</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5b600d02" id="u5b600d02">和 KV Cache 量化</span></strong></li><li fid="u36404897" data-lake-id="u4038aca7" id="u4038aca7"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucdde4512" id="ucdde4512">由于 FLATQUANT 所引入的仿射变换本质上属于</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc7f4c4c2" id="uc7f4c4c2">内存受限操作，作者进一步将仿射变换与量化操作融合至单个计算 Kernel 中，从而减少全局内存访问以及 Kernel 启动开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u582286e0" id="u582286e0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7fb91683" id="u7fb91683">主要贡献总结如下</span></strong></p><ul list="u2c325caf"><li fid="u9281e33d" data-lake-id="u09442687" id="u09442687"><span data-lake-id="uef957738" id="uef957738">强调</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u957cc016" id="u957cc016">分布平坦性对于 LLM 量化的重要性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub11138d8" id="ub11138d8">，表明更加平坦的权重和激活分布有助于降低量化难度，减轻量化误差在 Transformer 各层之间的传播与累积 </span></li><li fid="u9281e33d" data-lake-id="uc9e10d4f" id="uc9e10d4f"><span data-lake-id="uf19bef10" id="uf19bef10">提出一种新的训练后量化方法 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u69d7a4b7" id="u69d7a4b7">FLATQUANT</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u573b7695" id="u573b7695">。该方法针对每一个线性层优化快速且可学习的仿射变换，并能够有效提升 LLM 权重和激活分布的平坦性 </span></li><li fid="u9281e33d" data-lake-id="ue71bc039" id="ue71bc039"><span data-lake-id="ud639428f" id="ud639428f">该方法首次在 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5bb18f9b" id="u5bb18f9b">LLaMA-3-70B</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u159278a7" id="u159278a7"> 模型上，仅采用简单的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue2216632" id="ue2216632">最近邻舍入（Round-to-Nearest, RTN）W4A4 量化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue854d104" id="ue854d104">，便实现</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u160b34f4" id="u160b34f4">不超过 1% 的精度下降</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2b151346" id="u2b151346"> </span></li><li fid="u9281e33d" data-lake-id="ufab1b2d1" id="ufab1b2d1"><span data-lake-id="u92e07b48" id="u92e07b48">设计一种高效 Kernel，将</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u31eee097" id="u31eee097">仿射变换与量化操作进行融合</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u83c281d9" id="u83c281d9">。在 W4A4 量化设置下，与 FP16 基线相比，该 Kernel 可实现 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b2e7f1f" id="u1b2e7f1f">2.3× 的 Prefill 阶段加速</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7c231877" id="u7c231877">以及 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u210ca8dc" id="u210ca8dc">1.7× 的 Decode 阶段加速</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="PtodS" id="PtodS" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u8737253d" id="u8737253d">🐻</span><span data-lake-id="u0ac9cc15" id="u0ac9cc15"> 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐬 𝐨𝐧 𝐋𝐋𝐌 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u4ef9352e" id="u4ef9352e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud544b518" id="ud544b518">量化是一种常用的模型压缩与推理加速技术，可以有效降低模型大小和推理延迟</span></strong></p><ul list="ub90b1f3d"><li fid="u521f5af0" data-lake-id="u087f8adb" id="u087f8adb"><span data-lake-id="u8ccf65f4" id="u8ccf65f4">对于线性层</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3DXW%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F17ded6ca196d6b6031dc4f1034e628c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NsTQm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c52b8a8" id="u2c52b8a8">，量化可以将全精度权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bm%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe6586a8b19929027da61a4683df1037b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vPiCZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue02ab2e9" id="ue02ab2e9">或激活</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bk%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F43d285f5dc626ccdbbcffcb5f578b38b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PUYW9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6c147cc" id="ue6c147cc">转换为低比特表示，同时也可以选择对 KV Cache 进行量化。例如，b-bit 权重量化可以表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u86b58680" id="u86b58680" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BW%7D%3DQ_b(W)%3Ds%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5CPi_%7B%5C%5COmega(b)%7D(W%2Fs)%2C%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8dfb137549e1c0ad4eba8c3340ad9eb2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h6cwb%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua6085161"><li fid="ua14e1827" data-lake-id="ub7120cac" id="ub7120cac"><span data-lake-id="u27ac6e5c" id="u27ac6e5c">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ifjFZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e62a1b7" id="u6e62a1b7">表示</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7cd3fe68" id="u7cd3fe68">量化步长</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u04638ce4" id="u04638ce4">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPi(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7584df13854ea4f59396c5f64ad2732.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BUsdy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40ad6fea" id="u40ad6fea">表示投影函数，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5COmega(b)%3D%5C%5C%7B0%2C1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C2%5Eb-1%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2b1be320d51c1a9c9168723ef2598eab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VSZxR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u897b0dcc" id="u897b0dcc">表示所有 b-bit 整数点构成的集合</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue2c3b5c2" id="ue2c3b5c2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u03b0f082" id="u03b0f082" style="color: #004347">LLM 的输入激活</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94e79ad0c1aabeafef9e2fc4af6adf66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z9Uzv%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc036fd5f" id="uc036fd5f" style="color: #004347">中通常包含大量离群值。为降低这些离群值对量化的影响，一种常见方法是在权重和激活上进行逐通道缩放</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5b291ebb" id="u5b291ebb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3D%5C%5Cleft(X%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)W%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd1bc70cb6aff6509b96ab5d1beaf926.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j8Y3g%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ucf30ee63"><li fid="u2534c469" data-lake-id="u9a594890" id="u9a594890"><span data-lake-id="u387c0ffa" id="u387c0ffa">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb536cacb9e3cce4713b0a1955425b129.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jIJve%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u11e813a1" id="u11e813a1">表示逐通道缩放因子。该缩放向量通过同时考虑输入激活与权重的数值幅度，对激活分布进行平滑。对于第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F036441a335dd85c838f76d63a3db2363.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DGy23%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u135ecc0b" id="u135ecc0b">个通道，其缩放因子可以表示为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_j%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmax(%7CX_j%7C%5E%5C%5Calpha)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmax(%7CW_j%7C%5E%7B1-%5C%5Calpha%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff98c1c60112e64333a81b5770d816086.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oTlSL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u243ae1e6" id="u243ae1e6">。经过缩放后的权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)W%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe51b02f07e95cff3c77404491c233482.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PvrYK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7c22be7e" id="u7c22be7e">可以预先与原始权重进行融合，从而避免在运行时额外执行相应的缩放计算</span></li><li fid="u2534c469" data-lake-id="u926a032d" id="u926a032d"><span data-lake-id="u0114d04b" id="u0114d04b">一些方法进一步引入</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9919b03" id="ud9919b03">逐通道平移</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u44ff3ee1" id="u44ff3ee1">，将激活转换为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X-z)%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4c25f2f0a0fc707b053ca412cac2919b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UjyOJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2f07d086" id="u2f07d086">，以进一步减弱离群值带来的影响。还有方法进一步将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fabe4682edfb0957437aaffa2e880a674.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DYZ51%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u289182c6" id="u289182c6">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vQevY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5251c1cc" id="u5251c1cc">均设置为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5bac4d7e" id="u5bac4d7e">可学习参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udaa49245" id="udaa49245">，通过校准数据对其进行优化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf0997ef3" id="uf0997ef3"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubdc999c8" id="ubdc999c8" style="color: #004347">近期研究发现，Hadamard 矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B%2B1%2C-1%5C%5C%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f716b92ade3e183dca08b7e252942df.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tEWqN%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud4602bd6" id="ud4602bd6" style="color: #004347">对于平滑激活中的离群值尤其有效</span></strong></p><ul list="ue58548cb"><li fid="u3eec0800" data-lake-id="ufa2af4ac" id="ufa2af4ac"><span data-lake-id="ua16ea6c2" id="ua16ea6c2">与逐通道缩放不同，从矩阵乘法的角度来看，Per-channel Scaling 本质上仅对变换矩阵的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua9cc70f5" id="ua9cc70f5">对角元素</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6659463b" id="u6659463b">进行调整，因此每个通道仍然主要独立地进行缩放。相比之下，Hadamard 变换会对激活和权重的通道进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf33c0fef" id="uf33c0fef">旋转与混合</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2acbdedb" id="u2acbdedb">，从而将原本集中在少数通道中的离群值重新分布至所有通道，有效降低离群值的影响</span></li><li fid="u3eec0800" data-lake-id="u5611062b" id="u5611062b"><span data-lake-id="u029cbc89" id="u029cbc89">由于 Hadamard 矩阵具有正交性，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5E%5C%5Ctop%20H%3DI%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4476ad8f349c38aaef2447cecbe205f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yrXVc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b4c271b" id="u5b4c271b">，因此原始线性层</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3DXW%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F17ded6ca196d6b6031dc4f1034e628c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eSJDh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1fb00b9" id="ue1fb00b9">可以等价地改写为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3874991b" id="u3874991b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3DXW%5E%5C%5Ctop%3D(XH)(H%5E%5C%5Ctop%20W%5E%5C%5Ctop).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F23e5ffb87466c7b1f65cd1ead73078f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JjaWK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u284e4bd8"><li fid="u1d4b154a" data-lake-id="u0dc22bea" id="u0dc22bea"><span data-lake-id="u27d38e81" id="u27d38e81">首先对激活执行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22XH%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8cc7eb17676c887f8b126d0bcc5168b1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LipC0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaae22ec2" id="uaae22ec2">变换，同时对权重执行对应的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22WH%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b6492cae7eebbeb4f342b2f98ce764b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zefcV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uff18b132" id="uff18b132">变换，而不会改变线性层最终的计算结果。与逐通道缩放类似，变换后的权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22WH%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b6492cae7eebbeb4f342b2f98ce764b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sP9AV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40a003e0" id="u40a003e0">可以在模型部署之前进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uee98e84c" id="uee98e84c">离线预处理</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue35324d3" id="ue35324d3">，从而减少 Hadamard 变换在实际推理过程中带来的额外运行时开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ued65fe0c" id="ued65fe0c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u236f0be9" id="u236f0be9" style="color: #DF2A3F">权重与激活的平坦性：在去除离群值之后，分布更加平坦的张量通常更容易进行量化，这类张量通常也具有较低的峰度（Kurtosis）</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u928c2024" id="u928c2024" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1788364076345-2336f47e-668a-42db-9ae1-6e5b88ba1fb8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub8d4f724-956b-406b-8768-6a52f807a51%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubfbe936d-7061-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A940.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A264%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A118956%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1328%2C%22originHeight%22%3A373%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22(A)WOFTHE10TRANSFORMER%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A312%2C%22width%22%3A321%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22)XOFTHEL0HTRANSFORMER%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A284%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R(D)XOFTHE30MTRANSFORMER%22%2C%22x%22%3A966%2C%22y%22%3A314%2C%22width%22%3A344%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(C)WOFTHE30HTRANSFORMER%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A329%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYERINLLAMA-3-70B.%22%2C%22x%22%3A701%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A257%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYERINLLAMA-3-70B.%22%2C%22x%22%3A1023%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A263%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAVERINLLAMA-3-8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A261%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAVERINLLAMA-3-8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A371%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A244%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ER-CHANNELS%22%2C%22x%22%3A502%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A119%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220020003000%22%2C%22x%22%3A126%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHANNELS%22%2C%22x%22%3A137%2C%22y%22%3A270%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHANNELS%22%2C%22x%22%3A468%2C%22y%22%3A270%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A680%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A113%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220020003000%22%2C%22x%22%3A460%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220040006000%22%2C%22x%22%3A788%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FLATQUANT%22%2C%22x%22%3A955%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220040006000%22%2C%22x%22%3A1120%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A351%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A97%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHANNELS%22%2C%22x%22%3A790%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HADAMAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A766%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1012%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A123%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHANNELS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1126%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORIGINA%22%2C%22x%22%3A323%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1012%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A116%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SCALINC%22%2C%22x%22%3A595%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226000800%22%2C%22x%22%3A1218%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22400%22%2C%22x%22%3A588%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22400%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f4f4%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u29c4b0e0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue488f4a4"><li fid="u71e271a4" data-lake-id="u553c12fd" id="u553c12fd"><span data-lake-id="ucf746839" id="ucf746839">与原始分布相比，现有预量化变换虽然能够在一定程度上使激活分布更加平坦，但仍存在明显局限。例如，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufa1e7053" id="ufa1e7053">逐通道缩放</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua413b10e" id="ua413b10e">可以有效平坦化激活分布，但其代价是使权重分布的包络更加陡峭。该方法实际上是在权重与激活之间重新分配离群值，而无法同时获得平坦的权重和激活分布</span></li><li fid="u71e271a4" data-lake-id="u416360d4" id="u416360d4"><span data-lake-id="uda1906bc" id="uda1906bc">相比逐通道缩放，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uee08d0f6" id="uee08d0f6">Hadamard 变换</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udd07f22a" id="udd07f22a">能够同时改善权重和激活的平坦性，但在部分情况下仍会产生不理想的数值分布</span></li><li fid="u71e271a4" data-lake-id="u80365800" id="u80365800"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc6b14b32" id="uc6b14b32">FLATQUANT</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2212909e" id="u2212909e"> 能够更加稳定地同时平坦化权重和激活分布，从而为后续低比特量化提供更加有利的数值条件</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u745570fc" id="u745570fc"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub19c5d26" id="ub19c5d26" style="color: #DF2A3F">量化误差景观的平坦性：量化误差在 Transformer 网络中会不可避免地逐层传播，因此，分析不同预量化变换对量化误差传播的影响具有重要意义</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub9c239cb" id="ub9c239cb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1788364041349-a29bfb57-2648-4c7c-930c-a9cdd8493416.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0c2e2f86-5fab-4c0e-ab61-e165e0ac382%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubfbe936d-7061-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A751.7999877929688%2C%22height%22%3A222%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A225104%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1311%2C%22originHeight%22%3A387%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22(BHADAMARDTRANSFROM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A359%2C%22y%22%3A356%2C%22width%22%3A245%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DSTACKEDVIEW.%22%2C%22x%22%3A1063%2C%22y%22%3A355%2C%22width%22%3A166%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C)FLATOUANT%22%2C%22x%22%3A730%2C%22y%22%3A356%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A)PER-CHANNELSCALING%22%2C%22x%22%3A41%2C%22y%22%3A356%2C%22width%22%3A217%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A606%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A155%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ER-CHANNELSCALIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A406%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A166%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FLATQUANT%22%2C%22x%22%3A858%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HADAMARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A669%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OK210012%22%2C%22x%22%3A1056%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A943%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A115%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2220.75100..%22%2C%22x%22%3A699%2C%22y%22%3A295%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O.1210012%22%2C%22x%22%3A383%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A943%2C%22y%22%3A190%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A63%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%22%2C%22x%22%3A285%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A62%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22208%22%2C%22x%22%3A1218%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2233%22%2C%22x%22%3A577%2C%22y%22%3A217%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A89%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOKE1%22%2C%22x%22%3A718%2C%22y%22%3A309%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O.G%22%2C%22x%22%3A279%2C%22y%22%3A208%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A910%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A75%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222550%22%2C%22x%22%3A1036%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2220%22%2C%22x%22%3A883%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OK22100%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2220%22%2C%22x%22%3A551%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222550%22%2C%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A277%2C%22y%22%3A229%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2220%E5%85%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A223%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22255%22%2C%22x%22%3A35%2C%22y%22%3A282%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222S%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A163%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A55%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210%22%2C%22x%22%3A1241%2C%22y%22%3A262%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2230%22%2C%22x%22%3A518%2C%22y%22%3A311%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22100125%22%2C%22x%22%3A768%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f3f3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u79f5b786%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="ubfa0bd23"><li fid="u8edaf3ae" data-lake-id="ua9c60118" id="ua9c60118"><span data-lake-id="uea09aa8d" id="uea09aa8d">输入序列前部的 Token 往往会产生非常显著的量化误差。这类 Token 通常被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u68e47825" id="u68e47825">枢轴 Token</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u882f6b76" id="u882f6b76">，其内部往往包含幅度极大的激活离群值。对于这类误差，逐通道缩放和 Hadamard 变换均难以实现有效抑制。相比之下，FLATQUANT 在这些 Pivot Tokens 上表现出显著更低的量化误差</span></li><li fid="u8edaf3ae" data-lake-id="ube2fe81e" id="ube2fe81e"><span data-lake-id="u8162d712" id="u8162d712">其次，量化误差表现出明显的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8a5faa87" id="u8a5faa87">逐层累积</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucda2825a" id="ucda2825a">现象，即随着 Transformer 层数不断加深，量化误差会持续增大；误差沿输入序列维度的增长趋势并不明显</span></li><li fid="u8edaf3ae" data-lake-id="u614d737a" id="u614d737a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u23997bbf" id="u23997bbf">FLATQUANT 对量化误差逐层传播的抑制能力最强，其次是 Hadamard 变换，而逐通道缩放的效果相对最弱</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3f17422a" id="u3f17422a">。这表明，更加平坦的权重与激活分布不仅有利于降低当前层的量化误差，同时还能够有效减缓量化误差在深层 Transformer 网络中的累积与传播</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="Nd4Fq" id="Nd4Fq" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4624618c" id="u4624618c">🦢</span><span data-lake-id="uc3c51b30" id="uc3c51b30"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7cce842e" id="u7cce842e">𝐅𝐚𝐬𝐭 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐋𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐧𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐀𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐧𝐞 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="udc212fbc" id="udc212fbc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0b742873" id="u0b742873">FLATQUANT 的核心目标之一，是为每个待量化的线性层寻找最优的仿射变换。对于线性层</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3DXW%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F17ded6ca196d6b6031dc4f1034e628c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YYzwk%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u426bc3f7" id="u426bc3f7">，可以寻找一个最优的可逆矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%5E*%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe2dc9ed3f89c83ddcf616dd389834559.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hy1Z2%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8607caf7" id="u8607caf7">，使量化后的输出与全精度输出之间的误差最小</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ud1ac8d58" id="ud1ac8d58" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%5E*%3D%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_P%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7CY-Q(XP)Q(P%5E%7B-1%7DW%5E%5C%5Ctop)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2.%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff7386730421311ae967f09a4fa7d022f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gb5p9%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4051b444"><li fid="u1b3e98b1" data-lake-id="uec35daeb" id="uec35daeb"><span data-lake-id="ua78eaa5c" id="ua78eaa5c">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%5E%7B-1%7DW%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0ff7790b1d1292810574d9f9d79a9bd5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t6xmH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua87bbc07" id="ua87bbc07">可以在推理之前离线预计算，从而避免在运行时对权重执行额外变换。</span></li><li fid="u1b3e98b1" data-lake-id="ue76d6d03" id="ue76d6d03"><span data-lake-id="u96f94c49" id="u96f94c49">然而，与所有层均可共享同一 Hadamard 矩阵不同，为每个线性层分别维护一个完整的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F449a4ec4507e4580b646b9d5c5bb7a29.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SNAno%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufb367a7b" id="ufb367a7b">具有较高的计算和存储成本。在前向传播过程中，直接使用完整仿射矩阵会使矩阵变换所需的计算量和内存访问量近似翻倍，同时还会使模型额外存储开销接近原模型规模</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc8d0fdf4" id="uc8d0fdf4"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud834f357" id="ud834f357" style="color: #DF2A3F">FLATQUANT 的关键思想是利用两个轻量级矩阵的 Kronecker 积（Kronecker Product），替代规模较大的完整仿射变换矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F449a4ec4507e4580b646b9d5c5bb7a29.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RGYrt%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card></p><ul list="uf455ed26"><li fid="u636a37a2" data-lake-id="uede18360" id="uede18360"><span data-lake-id="u743aead4" id="u743aead4">具体而言，将变换矩阵构造为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%3DP_1%5C%5Cotimes%20P_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47bd4a3e97481303de14be7faa3c456a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RZLvP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u80fd6aca" id="u80fd6aca">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_1%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbccbe0480ae173339a138213b226dd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22znTUn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc76dd7b2" id="uc76dd7b2">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_2%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_2%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3682db55e7e1592b9b982bd0b313be38.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VasdH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8c503255" id="u8c503255">均为规模较小的可逆矩阵，并满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%3Dn_1n_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8b1652ec4ce18d4d949dc68653e886e1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BE7QX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua20da5da" id="ua20da5da">​</span></li><li fid="u636a37a2" data-lake-id="u24eb3acc" id="u24eb3acc"><span data-lake-id="ued9686ae" id="ued9686ae">根据 Kronecker 积的向量化性质，对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa52aad6a2861b98a663630f7795dece6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FNOVF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7506aad" id="ud7506aad">，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bvec%7D(V)(P_1%5C%5Cotimes%20P_2)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bvec%7D(P_1%5E%5C%5Ctop%20V%20P_2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c1f046f3b69dbe052e2ba452958a14c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ezcz2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1931b66c" id="u1931b66c">。因此上式中的矩阵乘法可以进一步改写</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc8eda3fc" id="uc8eda3fc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q(XP)Q(P%5E%7B-1%7DW%5E%5C%5Ctop)%5Cn%3D%5CnQ%5C%5Cleft(P_1%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Ctimes_1%5C%5Ctilde%7BX%7D%5C%5Ctimes_2P_2%5C%5Cright)%5CnQ%5C%5Cleft(P_1%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Ctimes_1%5C%5Ctilde%7BW%7D%5C%5Ctimes_2(P_2%5E%7B-1%7D)%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce41c8ab520467b29422606deb89b1ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PaUqA%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1477cc7f"><li fid="ua7e0d198" data-lake-id="u99e1766c" id="u99e1766c"><span data-lake-id="ua21007f2" id="ua21007f2">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7BX%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bk%5C%5Ctimes%20n_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe3aa462bbe91b5024c0c16e82a01048e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R0NQE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8cc45f00" id="u8cc45f00">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7BW%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bm%5C%5Ctimes%20n_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F58a5d2ca7e03d634c5bc1ae2eb8bd8da.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cJc1G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9ebb7d6" id="ue9ebb7d6">分别由原始的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94e79ad0c1aabeafef9e2fc4af6adf66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VeVG5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76b3976f" id="u76b3976f">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa36915ecf0b5605493f5aeaf1480a9ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MVgJF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3bfaa8a4" id="u3bfaa8a4">reshape 得到，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctimes_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F491a84f58f887899b4b261b6f0e96ba7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oAkfq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4addf1cb" id="u4addf1cb">表示沿第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OTA9i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a38623a" id="u1a38623a">个轴执行相应的张量-矩阵乘法。完成变换后，权重和激活均会重新转换为二维矩阵，再执行后续矩阵乘法</span></li><li fid="ua7e0d198" data-lake-id="u16f125f5" id="u16f125f5"><span data-lake-id="u452873b1" id="u452873b1">这种设计能够显著降低仿射变换矩阵的存储开销。完整矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffd1905f6d4d60accedfa6b91be93ea9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kdLj8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09ed85f1" id="u09ed85f1">需要存储</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb67c3aca1bcc34aec861fef4fbf09535.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mPjdd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7868cbdc" id="u7868cbdc">个元素，而 Kronecker 分解后仅需要存储</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_1%5E2%2Bn_2%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F679f635fab40769b10a1f173d3ef4045.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RDWDx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2b0699bd" id="u2b0699bd">个元素，其压缩比例满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bn%5E2%7D%7Bn_1%5E2%2Bn_2%5E2%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleq%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bn%5E2%7D%7B2n_1n_2%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bn%7D%7B2%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8779605a1e17a34d25fa54833012d450.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22I2yEk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubcf0bb77" id="ubcf0bb77">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_1%3Dn_2%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7Bn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f735480a6dc994997e527c6ec48308c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Aygex%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f2e819e" id="u0f2e819e">时取等号，因此理论上最多可以将额外存储需求降低约</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%2F2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffa7bcd294cefd4f4fc0363c5eac966e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kGwnr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0c7855e5" id="u0c7855e5">倍。在相同的最优条件下，计算开销最高可以降低约</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csqrt%7Bn%7D%2F2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5dcf1d8a84ce24038a11c67a239a2411.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AXqqv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1c834647" id="u1c834647">倍</span></li><li fid="ua7e0d198" data-lake-id="ue3a55c67" id="ue3a55c67"><span data-lake-id="ub988b2d5" id="ub988b2d5">在实际实现中，作者通过以下方式选择</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F75a79801b1f8d45fdfd7a0b0bbc8d02f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LpjrJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77869fe5" id="u77869fe5">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1b83e2a3d544d2b90cd33a8b662d3039.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22orCVZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce37baac" id="uce37baac">：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(n_1%5E*%2Cn_2%5E*)%3D%5Cn%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7Bn_1%2Cn_2%7D(n_1%2Bn_2)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%20%7D%20n_1n_2%3Dn%2C%5C%5C%3B%20n_1%5C%5Cleq%20n_2.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F049fa7d2ff46e360d8eb45249f087213.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WeohN%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue6764f9b" id="ue6764f9b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7fcb98c7" id="u7fcb98c7">Per-channel Scaling：FLATQUANT 在预量化变换之前显式引入一个可学习的逐通道缩放向量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2ebdb2149528d7025dbef8adf81c7581.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OExcg%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u9c1bf18c"><li fid="uc3a80251" data-lake-id="u3c7835f4" id="u3c7835f4"><span data-lake-id="uf99fb7c2" id="uf99fb7c2">该缩放向量可以成对融合至前一层的 LayerNorm 或线性层参数中，因此不会引入额外的在线推理计算开销。通过这一机制，FLATQUANT 可以首先调整不同通道之间的数值尺度，再利用后续可学习仿射变换进一步重新分布离群值</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2fbeffb4" id="u2fbeffb4"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud75b13f8" id="ud75b13f8">Learnable Clipping Thresholds：为进一步抑制经过上述变换后仍可能残留的离群值，FLATQUANT 针对每个线性层的权重和激活，以及 KV Cache，引入可学习的裁剪阈值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_w%2C%5C%5Calpha_a%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb57056246bd60129779000b0fc00beda.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dHFih%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6d43d32f" id="u6d43d32f">，并通过 Sigmoid 函数约束其取值范围</span></strong></p><ul list="u680e4c36"><li fid="u7cb30a12" data-lake-id="u7b92d277" id="u7b92d277"><span data-lake-id="ud3d0f981" id="ud3d0f981">虽然传统量化方法通常可以通过网格搜索获得较为合理的裁剪阈值，但作者发现，直接通过优化过程</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue260e054" id="ue260e054">学习裁剪阈值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5b219ca2" id="u5b219ca2">能够获得更好的量化效果</span></li><li fid="u7cb30a12" data-lake-id="ud22fbf56" id="ud22fbf56"><span data-lake-id="ud3f3d307" id="ud3f3d307">这些裁剪参数针对不同层分别设置，并可以与线性变换矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffd1905f6d4d60accedfa6b91be93ea9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AH8mJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u02c43396" id="u02c43396">以及逐通道缩放参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fabe4682edfb0957437aaffa2e880a674.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IHcfF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5bdd8d72" id="u5bdd8d72">进行联合优化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf54d4bd7" id="uf54d4bd7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a767792" id="u9a767792">Training Objective：FLATQUANT 遵循 PTQ 的基本范式，仅使用少量校准数据，例如随机采样的 128 个句子，依次对每个 Transformer Block 进行优化</span></strong></p><ul list="u967033c3"><li fid="u03ed6aa4" data-lake-id="uf0b3059f" id="uf0b3059f"><span data-lake-id="u60f8aaf3" id="u60f8aaf3">对于第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XyGtF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud686d57d" id="ud686d57d">个 Transformer Block，作者通过最小化量化模型输出与全精度模型输出之间的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u62dffe89" id="u62dffe89">均方误差</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u39fc3d80" id="u39fc3d80">来优化该 Block 中的变换参数</span></li><li fid="u03ed6aa4" data-lake-id="u04ab7f93" id="u04ab7f93"><span data-lake-id="ub6b556af" id="ub6b556af">FLATQUANT 并不重新训练整个模型，而是采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7b64f5b6" id="u7b64f5b6">Block-wise Calibration</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1e694adc" id="u1e694adc"> 的方式，逐个 Transformer Block 优化其中的仿射变换矩阵、逐通道缩放系数以及可学习裁剪阈值，从而在较低训练成本下减小量化引入的局部误差及其后续的逐层传播</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u43dca9af" id="u43dca9af" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1788365215266-264a1436-ecab-47e3-bda7-c000326602dc.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3e4df14c-a1f9-4226-8917-2d9ed9e9dcc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u22f3aeee-c6af-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A947%2C%22height%22%3A318%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A140761%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1215%2C%22originHeight%22%3A408%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PAIR-WISEYMERGEDSCALINGVECTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A155%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A284%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUANTIZATIONDEQUANTIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A141%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A261%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MERGEDWEIGHTQUANTIZED%22%2C%22x%22%3A159%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A227%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3AAFINETRANSFORMATIONMATRIX%22%2C%22x%22%3A105%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A258%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEED-FORWARDNETWORK%22%2C%22x%22%3A992%2C%22y%22%3A372%2C%22width%22%3A194%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A733%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A14%2C%22height%22%3A100%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RE-DISTRIBUTE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1009%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEARLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A1094%2C%22y%22%3A174%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SELF-ATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A539%2C%22y%22%3A372%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A125%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A947%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%2FDIAG(CER%22%2C%22x%22%3A949%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E-DISTRIBUTE%22%2C%22x%22%3A635%2C%22y%22%3A145%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IAG(CEUXN2XM%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22)CR1X72XK%22%2C%22x%22%3A1021%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A259%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A77%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KVCACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A361%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A495%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A11%2C%22height%22%3A67%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A620%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A13%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A861%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22x%22%3A819%2C%22y%22%3A256%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22x%22%3A480%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E%22%2C%22x%22%3A617%2C%22y%22%3A231%2C%22width%22%3A12%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A281%2C%22y%22%3A256%2C%22width%22%3A12%2C%22height%22%3A50%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22x%22%3A777%2C%22y%22%3A265%2C%22width%22%3A11%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A220%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22x%22%3A817%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23898477%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u001749a3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="i6ITq" id="i6ITq" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u747784c2" id="u747784c2">🐟</span><span data-lake-id="uae916a62" id="uae916a62"> 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐞𝐫 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ucc534298" id="ucc534298"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a43b07b" id="u9a43b07b">在 Self-Attention 模块中，FLATQUANT 引入四个变换矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7BP_a%2CP_o%2CP_h%2CP_v%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d19353c7d1f2c377e917091ebc5558b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XTZ46%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucebd3b07" id="ucebd3b07">。其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38b0ebcc3cd17845a7fd86182b093d51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EQvrl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud32b6a7d" id="ud32b6a7d">用于平坦化 Query、Key 和 Value 投影之前的输入激活，而</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_o%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29b40494db4fc7948b92fce2bbcff2fd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g4GIr%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6fb5bf92" id="u6fb5bf92">用于平坦化 Output Projection 的输入激活。</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff58a7d88d361ee77b06fbbbc487f18ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AhtdC%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub9b1a367" id="ub9b1a367">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9e97ec97dfd7fb548c494f32c2c79c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sZawt%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u96349d7b" id="u96349d7b">则分别以 Head 为单位，对 Key Cache 和 Value Cache 进行变换</span></strong></p><ul list="uc7454789"><li fid="u3368a72d" data-lake-id="u61f206a8" id="u61f206a8"><span data-lake-id="ue05bd642" id="ue05bd642">FLATQUANT 仅对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38b0ebcc3cd17845a7fd86182b093d51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h7WVI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub472464d" id="ub472464d">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_o%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29b40494db4fc7948b92fce2bbcff2fd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eW0mJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udf55bde6" id="udf55bde6">采用前文介绍的 Kronecker 分解，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff58a7d88d361ee77b06fbbbc487f18ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22So2tG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9cb9886" id="ue9cb9886">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9e97ec97dfd7fb548c494f32c2c79c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JzePA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u99be4ab7" id="u99be4ab7">保持完整矩阵形式</span></li><li fid="u3368a72d" data-lake-id="u15da90b3" id="u15da90b3"><span data-lake-id="u1d26f2c7" id="u1d26f2c7">KV Cache 通常采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud36e12d8" id="ud36e12d8">Per-head Quantization</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6fd51e4c" id="u6fd51e4c">，而单个 Attention Head 的维度远小于完整 Hidden Size，因此直接进行矩阵变换所产生的计算和存储开销已经较低，无需进一步进行 Kronecker 分解。为进一步降低运行时开销，作者将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_o%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29b40494db4fc7948b92fce2bbcff2fd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xb07P%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3665d92" id="uf3665d92">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9e97ec97dfd7fb548c494f32c2c79c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eVTp6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u62c485a9" id="u62c485a9">进行融合</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufe2fdc69" id="ufe2fdc69"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0855db54" id="u0855db54">对于前馈网络，FLATQUANT 使用两个变换矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Bug%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fefc055552ffa700aaa61e749f568e934.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JwKRG%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u99f8edc9" id="u99f8edc9">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa90ba0dc247ccb9572763a891c1f2f4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22urppk%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufe1cf850"><li fid="ufa0ea75e" data-lake-id="u499ee004" id="u499ee004"><span data-lake-id="uf3a04a16" id="uf3a04a16">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Bug%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fefc055552ffa700aaa61e749f568e934.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V4Ndr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u19bc88d2" id="u19bc88d2">用于平坦化 LayerNorm 之后、进入 FFN 的输入激活；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa90ba0dc247ccb9572763a891c1f2f4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QbptO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uea2808ac" id="uea2808ac">则用于平坦化 Down Projection 层的输入激活。为尽可能降低推理开销，这两个变换矩阵均采用 Kronecker 分解。此外</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa90ba0dc247ccb9572763a891c1f2f4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QJacL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7997aa95" id="u7997aa95">对应的逐通道缩放参数可以进一步融合至 Up Projection 层的权重中，因此不会引入额外的在线计算开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u094fda27" id="u094fda27"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5de7cc48" id="u5de7cc48">已有旋转量化方法通常利用 RMSNorm 的结构特性，将正交变换融合至前序网络层，从而减少额外的推理计算</span></strong></p><ul list="ue73648ce"><li fid="ub3fab4e5" data-lake-id="u9508b09d" id="u9508b09d"><span data-lake-id="u175d27a3" id="u175d27a3">在采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u67405e13" id="u67405e13">Pre-Norm</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4bf02319" id="u4bf02319"> 结构的 Transformer 中，由于存在 Residual Connection，如果直接将这类变换融合至 RMSNorm 前后的计算路径中，会使不同 Transformer Block 受到残差连接的约束，从而不得不共享相同的变换矩阵，限制不同层分别学习最优变换的能力</span></li><li fid="ub3fab4e5" data-lake-id="u381760e6" id="u381760e6"><span data-lake-id="u8e6d1186" id="u8e6d1186">FLATQUANT 保留原有的 LayerNorm，并允许不同线性层在 LayerNorm 之后分别使用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u17fa4ce4" id="u17fa4ce4">快速且可学习的仿射变换</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubaf14fae" id="ubaf14fae"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaeb419de" id="uaeb419de">作者进一步为 FLATQUANT 设计高效 Kernel，将仿射变换与量化操作融合至单个 Kernel 中</span></strong></p><ul list="u16dfc830"><li fid="u8c424e4d" data-lake-id="u77897787" id="u77897787"><span data-lake-id="uf193b610" id="uf193b610">首先，由于 FLATQUANT 使用两个轻量级矩阵的 Kronecker Product，因此变换</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_1%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Ctimes_1%5C%5Ctilde%7BX%7D%5C%5Ctimes_2P_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd25401fa269135581226d691b4304a37.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zCwpW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d5fe1f2" id="u5d5fe1f2">的计算强度较低，使得该操作无论在 Prefill 阶段还是 Decode 阶段都主要表现为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6622cc6e" id="u6622cc6e">Memory-bound</span></strong></li><li fid="u8c424e4d" data-lake-id="u0fbf1fca" id="u0fbf1fca"><span data-lake-id="ue9c5b18e" id="ue9c5b18e">其次，量化操作本身同样属于典型的 Memory-bound 操作。如果分别执行仿射变换和量化，就需要反复将中间结果写入和读取 Global Memory，从而产生额外的内存访问与 Kernel Launch 开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufad20cb4" id="ufad20cb4"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub1c2e28c" id="ub1c2e28c">为解决这一问题，作者基于 OpenAI Triton，将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%5C%5Cleft(P_1%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Ctimes_1%5C%5Ctilde%7BX%7D%5C%5Ctimes_2P_2%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0aa16b29d714327c64fa75fff5b2988c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UX3LP%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f69fcf9" id="u8f69fcf9">整体融合为一个 Kernel</span></strong></p><ul list="u16dfc830" start="3"><li fid="u8c424e4d" data-lake-id="u74939caa" id="u74939caa"><span data-lake-id="u3b75a493" id="u3b75a493">Kernel 首先将完整的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_1%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbccbe0480ae173339a138213b226dd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MiYJO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a07e8fc" id="u4a07e8fc">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_2%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_2%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3682db55e7e1592b9b982bd0b313be38.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ENq7h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd28a1c8" id="udd28a1c8">加载至片上 SRAM。随后，每个 Thread Block 从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7BX%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95edf82eb8cc264732c442b7e9d89ad5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gybCM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u07388bb5" id="u07388bb5">中切分出一个大小为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7BX%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F755d86ec1f752247aed3100d0f9590d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aL55h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d53a200" id="u7d53a200">的 Tile，并直接计算矩阵变换</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_1%5C%5Cbar%7BX%7DP_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff128468be8bd3e5b425ea4bec8cc5280.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FLJC4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u34ae730d" id="u34ae730d">，随后立即对计算结果执行量化</span></li><li fid="u8c424e4d" data-lake-id="u908208e7" id="u908208e7"><span data-lake-id="u39351a40" id="u39351a40">在整个计算过程中，中间结果始终保存在 SRAM 中，只有最终量化后的结果才会写回 Global Memory。因此，该融合设计避免仿射变换中间结果反复写入和读取 Global Memory 所产生的冗余内存访问，同时减少额外的 Kernel Launch 开销，从而显著降低 FLATQUANT 在线变换的实际推理成本</span></li><li fid="u8c424e4d" data-lake-id="u73d34d26" id="u73d34d26"><span data-lake-id="u0c790055" id="u0c790055">在获得量化后的输出之后，FLATQUANT 进一步采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="udc012cb6" id="udc012cb6">CUTLASS Kernel</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue4dfcde4" id="ue4dfcde4"> 执行 INT4 矩阵乘法，并使用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u25144859" id="u25144859">FlashInfer</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ude3518a2" id="ude3518a2"> 完成 KV Cache 量化</span></li></ul>